article.common-document
  header.header
    h2.title BBJ1K dataset
  .contents
    section.section
      h3.sectiontitle Summary
      p.body
        | The
        |
        a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/') NBDC Human Database
        | /
        a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://www.ddbj.nig.ac.jp/jga/index-e.html') Japanese Genotype-phenotype Archive (JGA)
        |  reanalyzed the individual-level WGS data in
        |
        a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/dataset/JGAD000220') JGAD000220
        |  from 1,026 participants enrolled in
        |
        a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://biobankjp.org/english/index.html') BioBank Japan
        |  between fiscal years 2003 and 2007 and produced
        |
        a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/dataset/JGAD000758') JGAD000758
        | , a joint-called aggregate VCF dataset containing individual-level genotypes. TogoVar provides the allele
        | frequencies and genotype counts calculated from JGAD000758 as the dataset-specific frequency dataset “BBJ1K” in
        |
        a.hyper-text.-internal(href='/doc/datasets/jga_wgs') JGA-WGS
        | .
      ul.unordered-list
        li Sample size: 1,026
        li Number of alternate alleles searchable in TogoVar: 44,694,482

    section.section
      h3.sectiontitle Data processing method
      ul.unordered-list
        li
          | Explanation:
          |
          a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/whole-genome-sequencing') Whole genome sequencing analysis data (germline)
        li
          | Workflow Source Code (jga-analysis):
          |
          a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://github.com/ddbj/jga-analysis') https://github.com/ddbj/jga-analysis

    section.section
      h3.sectiontitle Terms of use
      .subsection
        h4.heading Rights of Data Users
        p.body
          | The rights of data users shall conform to "5-2-1. Open Data" in "5-2. Rights of Data Users" listed in
          |
          a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/guidelines/data-sharing-guidelines')
            | the NBDC Human Data Sharing Guidelines.
        ol.ordered-list
          li
            | The data user can freely present the result of the study for which data from the NBDC Human Database
            | are used.
          li
            | The data user can freely acquire intellectual property rights based on the result of the study for
            | which data from the NBDC Human Database are used.
      .subsection
        h4.heading Responsibilities of Data Users
        p.body
          | Terms of "5-3-1. Open Data" in "5-3. Responsibilities of Data Users" listed in the NBDC Human Data
          | Sharing Guidelines shall apply with modification to the responsibilities of data users. As for
          | redistribution of data, terms for controlled-access data shall apply because this dataset was generated
          | by processing controlled-access data.
        ol.ordered-list
          li
            | In using data, the user must take responsibility for and make judgments concerning the quality,
            | content, and scientific validity of the data.
          li
            | The data user must comply with the following rules.
            ul.unordered-list
              li The use of data is limited to the study being undertaken.
              li Identification of individuals is prohibited
              li Redistribution of data is prohibited.
          li
            | The data user must add the following citation while using the data in public
            | (e.g. publishing an article).
            p
              | Variant dataset aggregated from NGS data in
              |
              a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/')
                | NBDC Human Database
              | /
              a(target='_blank', href='https://www.ddbj.nig.ac.jp/jga/index-e.html') JGA
              | [Internet]. Kashiwa: Database Center for Life Science, Joint Support-Center for Data Science Research,
              |
              | Research Organization of Information and Systems; [2024] - . BBJ1K dataset; [cited YYYY Mmm DD]. Available from:
              |
              a(href='https://grch38.togovar.org/doc/datasets/bbj1k') https://grch38.togovar.org/doc/datasets/bbj1k

    section.section
